        "text": "=You are an inventory assistant.\n\nInventory:\nProduct: {{ $json.Product }}\nCurrent Stock: {{ $json['Current Stock'] }}\nWeekly Sales: {{ $json['Weekly Sales'] }}\nLead Time: {{ $json['Lead Time'] }}\nWeeks Remaining: {{ $json['Weeks Remaining'] }}\nStock Risk: {{ $json['Stock Risk'] }}\n\nBased on the inventory information, provide a concise recommended action.\n\nReturn ONLY:\n\nProduct: [product name]\nWeeks Remaining: [number]\nStock Risk: [High/Medium/Low]\nRecommended Action: [one concise action]",
